repository-code: "https://github.com/CEMS-Lab/PhAST"
url: "https://cems-lab.github.io/PhAST/"
abstract: "A PyTorch-native finite-element solver for reproducible two-dimensional phase-field fracture, explicit dynamics, and selected solid-mechanics workflows. Supported tensor operations can be used in differentiability studies; the public software does not provide a general-purpose inverse-analysis framework."
